OL,3,GNEWSA'I am having to rewire my brain
OL,4,Aafter abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"One day I want to be able to see an
OL,7,Farm raised to pick something up without
OL,8,Fflinching", a woman who survived a
OL,9,Fcampaign of abuse has said.
OL,11,FThe survivor, who is remaining
OL,12,Fanonymous to protect her identity,
OL,13,Fspoke out about the campaign of
OL,14,Fcontrolling and coercive behaviour,
OL,15,Fviolence, and stalking she was
OL,16,Fsubjected to by Stuart Wilshire.
OL,18,FWilshire, 31, of Portland Street in
OL,19,FLeamington, Warwickshire, also
OL,20,Fthreatened to share images of her
OL,21,Fonline and was jailed for 30 months on
OL,22,F12 October.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
