OL,3,GNEWSA'I am having to rewire my brain
OL,4,Aafter abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe abuse survivor said she has had to
OL,7,Frewire her brain after her suffering
OL,8,Fbut assured other victims that "there
OL,9,Fis hope" and "a way out".
